# Ragdolls (GAME-5): build the skinned tube's ragdoll as one undo step, then play: RagdollProbe.cs
# makes it go limp a second in, checks it fell onto the floor, and that it blends back up.
#   Havana --scene Assets/Scenes/Tests/RagdollTest.lvl --editor-exec Assets/Scenes/Tests/RagdollFlows.edscript
wait 60
select Tube
ragdoll-build
assert-ragdoll-bones 3
undo
assert-ragdoll-bones 0
redo
assert-ragdoll-bones 3
screenshot .tmp/overhaul/shots/ragdoll_built.png

play
assert-playing 1
wait-log RagdollProbe: PASS | 1200
stop
